#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/system.rst:3
#: 6040d2758f484692a536282e0f94ca47
msgid "System Commands"
msgstr "系统命令"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/system.rst:5
#: 5c26fc1b9e114bf0a1b7cd53a2216cc5
msgid "There are a number of overall system and miscellaneous commands:"
msgstr "以下是若干整体系统及杂项命令："

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/system.rst:8
#: e12628b1f7c842118a640c5f244a7d77
msgid "reboot"
msgstr "reboot"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/system.rst:10
#: 7b664c53a2cd4dbd8c4a1ef3629514fa
msgid "Reboots the APM."
msgstr "重启APM。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/system.rst:13
#: 14cc20307b4a4b4e8c4833b211a46887
msgid "setup"
msgstr "setup"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/system.rst:15
#: 76953f2aa427459baff6217bdfed5abf
msgid "Goes into the setup (CLI) mode of the APM."
msgstr "进入APM的设置（CLI）模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/system.rst:18
#: f507edd37ef74583a9c04f72f22f0832
msgid "rc"
msgstr "rc"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/system.rst:20
#: 8caa8787425c4b38936e2aab0eb66761
msgid ""
"Override a RC (input) channel. This value remains in effect until a value of"
" 0 is set. Uses the form of ``rc chan value``. Use ``all`` to set a global "
"value for all RC channels."
msgstr ""
"覆盖RC（输入）通道。该值在设置为0之前持续有效。格式为 ``rc chan value``。使用 ``all`` 为所有RC通道设置全局值。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/system.rst:30
#: 11eb5aa3673a404282d717ae7176c594
msgid "time"
msgstr "time"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/system.rst:32
#: 8625268874fc4c18856ca1523cd0f86c
msgid ""
"Displays the current time from the autopilot, if supported. The time in "
"brackets is the ground station time."
msgstr "显示飞控当前时间（如支持）。括号内为地面站时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/system.rst:36
#: daec99e478f448bba61a9066dd116d1d
msgid "script"
msgstr "script"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/system.rst:38
#: 7b475616545549ac932927717b953513
msgid ""
"Runs a text file containing MAVProxy commands, much like the :ref:`mavinit "
"file <mavproxy-mavinit>`."
msgstr "运行包含MAVProxy命令的文本文件，类似于 :ref:`mavinit文件 <mavproxy-mavinit>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/system.rst:41
#: 3b3f1c5736704dd7a20165ec21e3ffed
msgid "shell"
msgstr "shell"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/system.rst:43
#: 40f854fdacee432687556a4a69073f47
msgid "Run a shell command."
msgstr "运行Shell命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/system.rst:46
#: e8d5d5702ba248babad7afe6a64c24f7
msgid "status"
msgstr "status"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/system.rst:48
#: e1ffbd0e64044a46bce429b5b16f644c
msgid ""
"Shows the latest packets received from the autopilot. Useful for reading the"
" state of the UAV."
msgstr "显示从飞控收到的最新数据包，可用于读取无人机状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/system.rst:52
#: f68149eca129415c993e7de8fe8c006d
msgid "exit"
msgstr "exit"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/system.rst:54
#: 2308a52ff5c848c7b2e87a086f316140
msgid "Exits MAVProxy."
msgstr "退出MAVProxy。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/system.rst:58
#: dddc1c11b87944f4bffa8de5f3e7bb18
msgid ""
"This requires the \"requireexit\" option to be true in order to work. This "
"can be done via the following command:"
msgstr "此命令需要将「requireexit」选项设为true方可生效，可通过以下命令完成配置："
